        {
            "id": "20261119A07G9E00",
            "title": "盒马自有化妆品牌来袭：赫莲娜平替卖49块",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O0g3rrobDLQFU0joz7iaj3vU9BKZRl0TvZucfI6tYXwtQAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261119A07G9E00",
            "author": "日积月累30天",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 12:18:06",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><blockquote class=\"author\" data-type=\"1\"><p><span>界面新闻记者 | </span><span class=\"author_name\">朱咏玲</span></p><p><span>界面新闻编辑 | </span><span class=\"edit_name\">楼婍沁</span></p></blockquote><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>继奥乐齐的超低价自有美妆品牌火出圈后，盒马也进一步发力自有美妆品牌，旗下品牌Juwow近日推出了多款面部护肤品，售价基本都不超过50元。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>界面新闻走访盒马线下门店看到，在位置有限的个护美妆货架，盒马的自有品牌产品占据着黄金位置，包括精华、乳、霜、唇膏等。店员告诉界面新闻，部分产品是近一两个月刚上架的。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><figure class=\"content-img-focus img-focus\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/ONdMYqf4IMLzIvCmFM7uDOwNqby4F09G2GD_66ouxfzrwAA/1000\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/ONdMYqf4IMLzIvCmFM7uDOwNqby4F09G2GD_66ouxfzrwAA/1000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/><figcaption class=\"caption-align-right\">图片来源：界面新闻 朱咏玲</figcaption></figure><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>界面新闻在现场并无看到有消费者在该货架前停留，店内客流更多集中在生鲜区域。不过盒马APP显示，一些自有品牌美妆新品在线上已有数百条购后评价。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>界面新闻就自有美妆品牌业务向盒马寻求采访，截至发稿未获回复。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这不是盒马第一次卖自有品牌化妆品。其自有美妆品牌Juwow在2024年就已经推出，早期主要卖香薰产品，后来向个护美妆延伸。化妆品监管APP显示，Juwow自2025年9月至今已有42款备案化妆品，包括头发、身体和面部护理产品。除Juwow外，盒马自2022年以来也有多款直接以“盒马”为品牌名的备案化妆品，覆盖品类与Juwow相似。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>不过，盒马此前销售的自有化妆品，大多是面膜、护手霜、身体乳等相对基础的品类，而近期上架的则是水、乳、霜、精华等更讲究“技术含量”的品类。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>界面新闻在盒马APP上看到，盒马近期上线的新品包括，主打抗皱修护的精粹水，核心成分是“贵妇品牌”赫莲娜也在用的高山火绒草提取物；号称使用了专利积雪草、有五重功效的乳液；添加了30%浓度玻色因的面霜——玻色因最早是欧莱雅的专利原料，如今也被不少高端护肤品所用。另外还有玻尿酸次抛精华、胶原次抛精华、祛痘修护精华水等多款新品。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><figure class=\"content-img-focus img-focus\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OiCp_c99rqCsgo5CNfg-umm9_1HKp6r54FqN9VLYJtVccAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OiCp_c99rqCsgo5CNfg-umm9_1HKp6r54FqN9VLYJtVccAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/><figcaption class=\"caption-align-right\">图片来源：界面新闻 朱咏玲</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"content-img-focus img-focus\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OPqo-QA19UWuNyyQXIin0-twC0bH7pTqopAJZe0tSoH5UAA/1000\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OPqo-QA19UWuNyyQXIin0-twC0bH7pTqopAJZe0tSoH5UAA/1000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/><figcaption class=\"caption-align-right\">图片来源：界面新闻 朱咏玲</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"content-img-focus img-focus\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OaSUB6_JYzJpx_Zx_qdD3rtJShG8l-lLE3EhPyR3YwPrMAA/1000\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OaSUB6_JYzJpx_Zx_qdD3rtJShG8l-lLE3EhPyR3YwPrMAA/1000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/><figcaption class=\"caption-align-right\">图片来源：界面新闻 朱咏玲</figcaption></figure><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这些产品无一例外都是走性价比路线。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>比如，与赫莲娜用了相似成分的精粹水，售价是49.9元/200毫升，是赫莲娜精华水的不到二十分之一。其他水、乳、霜等产品价格也基本在29.9元到49.9元之间。即便不跟大牌比较，这个价格在护肤品市场上也相当平价。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>根据毕马威</span></span><span><span>《2025年中国美妆市场行业报告》，2024年中国护肤品市场份额</span></span><span><span>中</span></span><span><span>，100元以上产品所占份额超70%，其中100元至300元产品占比最大，接近30%。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>尽管卖得便宜，盒马自有化妆品品牌背后的供应商却并非小作坊。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>根据化妆品监管APP，Juwow的两款乳液来自国际化妆品代工巨头科丝美诗；一款精华水来自上市公司“北交所美妆制造第一股”<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">芭薇股份</span></span></span>；一款胶原次抛精华来自创健医疗旗下子公司，创健医疗是国内头部的重组胶原蛋白原料商之一；佰草集、玉泽母公司<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">上海家化</span></span></span>也为Juwow生产了身体乳和护手霜；面膜产品则来自<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">诺斯贝尔</span></span></span>和恩客斯，前者是A股上市公司，后者是跟科丝美诗一样来自韩国的化妆品供应商，面膜正是其擅长品类。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>此外，Juwow的供应商还包括广州栋方、珠海伊斯佳、中山中研、上海仪玳等，这些对大众而言相对陌生的名字，都是市面上不少知名化妆品牌的合作厂商。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>值得注意的是，界面新闻梳理发现，Juwow真正开始与多元供应商合作，也就是今年下半年的事情。2026年7月以前，Juwow绝大部分备案化妆品的厂商都是楚雅化妆品——这家名不见经传的公司可查的公开资料并不多。此后，Juwow开拓了其他多家供应商，产品丰富度也随之提升。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><figure class=\"content-img-focus img-focus\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O0SM7XCUdRFFfgDO_sYAQG_s-qT0OSisge3JrMH1d4nFAAA/1000\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O0SM7XCUdRFFfgDO_sYAQG_s-qT0OSisge3JrMH1d4nFAAA/1000\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/><figcaption class=\"caption-align-right\">图片来源：界面新闻 朱咏玲</figcaption></figure><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>中国的供应链优势降低了盒马这类渠道商下场做自营美妆的门槛。在<!-- -->ODM<!-- -->合作模式下，供应商能提供从配方开发、产品备案到最终生产的全流程服务。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>科丝美诗方面告诉界面新闻，像盒马这类渠道商客户在其客户中已经占据一定比重，其内部有专门的团队为这一类客户服务。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>直接找源头厂商做自有品牌，相比采购外部品牌的商品，可以与供应商协商成本，也跳过了品牌商、经销商等层层环节，便于把控成本，提高利润。这也是为何如今商超发展自有品牌已是大势所趋。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>但化妆品尤其是“上脸”的护肤品，尝鲜门槛往往比一般日用品或食品等品类更高，因为信任也是消费者决策中很重要的一部分。而盒马并非专业的美妆零售商，消费者对其美妆品类的信任基础并不深厚。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>也因为如此，低价对盒马自有美妆品牌而言，不天然就是加分项。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>多位消费者都告诉界面新闻，她们不会因为盒马的自有护肤品品牌卖得便宜而买单，甚至“便宜”正是她们顾虑的一个原因。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“太便宜了，用在脸上的东西，不太敢尝试。除非有消费者真的使用后推荐，才会考虑。”有消费者对界面新闻说。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>可以参考的是，另一超市品牌奥乐齐的自有美妆品牌Lacura也是走大牌“平替”路线，低价和对大牌产品外包装的“像素级”模仿是其引发关注的原因，但真正影响消费者决策的，更多是社交平台上的真实使用评价。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>而从消费者评价来看，人们对于奥乐齐的大牌“平替”产品的预期实际上也是理性的，并不指望它跟大牌一模一样，只求它在这一价位上有高性价比。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>美妆生活方式媒体播肆poise创始人陶骋也告诉界面新闻，头部供应商只意味着在工艺质量上有更多保障，但不决定产品的功效表现。“产品功效如何，不取决于工厂，而取决于用料的成本。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>陶骋还提到，令大牌美妆真正起效的通常也不是单一成分，而是配方里多款成分的协同效应。“本质上并不存在真正的大牌‘平替’。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>无论是盒马还是奥乐齐，目前在产品开发上都是选择已被市场检验过的热门功效和品类，注重快速上新和扩充SKU。这种方式的优势就在于省去了试探市场的成本。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>陶骋认为，这种逻辑更适用于身体护理和清洁发品，但对讲求专业性的功效护肤品来说，不是长久之计。</p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>商超下场做平价自有美妆品牌的生意，可能是嗅到了大众美妆市场的机会。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>魔镜洞察的数据显示，2026年第一季度中国护肤线上市场呈现出“两头翘”的形态——100元以内价格带销售额同比增长12.5%，1000元到2000元价格带销售额增长27.7%。而占比最大的100元到300元价格带，销售额仅增长0.6%。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>不过，高端价格带的高速增长也反映出理性消费趋势下的一个心态。“与其少花钱买一个功效不确定的产品，不如花更多钱买效果稳定的大品牌。”陶骋对界面新闻说。</p><p>这对于主要面向城市中产客群的盒马来说，或许更有参考价值。​​​​​​</p></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
        },
